<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.640" end="00:00:04.480" style="s2">I told you to take your hand off me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.720" end="00:00:06.720" style="s2">Don&#39;t ever put your hands on me again.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.480" end="00:00:09.440" style="s2">You&#39;ve got some nerve. Do you actually</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.720" end="00:00:11.200" style="s2">know what you&#39;ve just done? Yes. I</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.440" end="00:00:13.679" style="s2">stopped you from bullying me. And I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.200" end="00:00:16.000" style="s2">do it again if I have to. Alex, enough.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.679" end="00:00:18.080" style="s2">Everyone&#39;s watching.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.000" end="00:00:20.080" style="s2">At West Brbridge Crown, a family name</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.080" end="00:00:21.920" style="s2">could open almost any [music] door. But</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.080" end="00:00:24.920" style="s2">one student was about to challenge</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.920" end="00:00:24.920" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.840" end="00:00:37.600" style="s2">This place is ridiculous. My old school</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.920" end="00:00:39.200" style="s2">could fit inside that courtyard.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.600" end="00:00:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome to West Brbridge. Even the</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.200" end="00:00:41.920" style="s2">buildings have family money.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.480" end="00:00:43.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please tell me the students are slightly</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.920" end="00:00:45.680" style="s2">less intimidating. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.760" end="00:00:49.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wouldn&#39;t count on. Dad gave me the</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.680" end="00:00:51.760" style="s2">Bentley for passing my exams.</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.039" end="00:00:52.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How tragic. Mine only offered to pay my</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.760" end="00:00:54.480" style="s2">tuition.</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.960" end="00:00:57.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your family&#39;s clearly struggling.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.480" end="00:01:00.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. We&#39;re already late and I refuse</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.120" end="00:01:00.920" style="s2">to arrive looking ordinary.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.600" end="00:01:06.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; West Brbridge Crown. End of the line,</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.359" end="00:01:06.720" style="s2">mate. Thanks. First day. Any survival</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.159" end="00:01:10.840" style="s2">advice?</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.720" end="00:01:10.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep leaves room for the egos.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.880" end="00:01:16.640" style="s2">Dad&#39;s already arranged dinner with the</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.240" end="00:01:18.000" style="s2">chancellor</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.640" end="00:01:20.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; on your first day. That&#39;s actually</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.000" end="00:01:23.960" style="s2">absurd.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.720" end="00:01:23.960" style="s2">Well, Ethan,</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.119" end="00:01:28.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; looks like the</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.560" end="00:01:30.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you certain? I could make one call</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.720" end="00:01:31.520" style="s2">and arrange everything. That&#39;s exactly</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.479" end="00:01:33.600" style="s2">what I don&#39;t want.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.520" end="00:01:34.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No [music] favors. No one knowing who I</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.600" end="00:01:36.799" style="s2">am.</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.479" end="00:01:38.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Just remember, you can call</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.799" end="00:01:41.759" style="s2">me anytime.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.159" end="00:01:44.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.759" end="00:01:45.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, new student. Registration</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.400" end="00:01:47.119" style="s2">documents, please.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.360" end="00:01:48.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning. Ethan Cole, finance and</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.119" end="00:01:50.880" style="s2">investment research. I think</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.240" end="00:01:52.399" style="s2">everything&#39;s in there. Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.880" end="00:01:54.399" style="s2">Welcome to West Bridge, Ethan. I hope</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.399" end="00:01:56.560" style="s2">you enjoy your time here.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.399" end="00:01:59.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. I intend to.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.560" end="00:02:01.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi, Ethan. Cole. First day here. You lot</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.600" end="00:02:02.719" style="s2">studying finance as well. Business</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.119" end="00:02:05.280" style="s2">management. Our families have been</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.719" end="00:02:08.479" style="s2">coming here for years. That&#39;s nice. So,</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.280" end="00:02:10.399" style="s2">you already know your way around then.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.479" end="00:02:13.200" style="s2">More or less. We know the important</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.399" end="00:02:14.720" style="s2">people. Honestly, it is way too crowded</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.200" end="00:02:16.640" style="s2">here. Let&#39;s just head over to the main</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.720" end="00:02:18.319" style="s2">courtyard. Yeah, totally. Much better</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.640" end="00:02:19.440" style="s2">atmosphere there. And Olivia said she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.319" end="00:02:21.520" style="s2">already there.</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.440" end="00:02:24.811" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect. Let&#39;s get out of here then.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.520" end="00:02:24.811" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sound plan. See you there. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.720" end="00:02:32.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are looking for the scholarship</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.000" end="00:02:34.640" style="s2">desk, aren&#39;t you? It&#39;s further down the</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.000" end="00:02:38.319" style="s2">hall, right around that corner.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.640" end="00:02:41.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, I see. Thank you. I&#39;ll try not to</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.319" end="00:02:41.480" style="s2">get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.441" end="00:02:44.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.680" end="00:02:50.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that Alexander Whitmore?</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.560" end="00:02:53.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His father&#39;s practically royalty in</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.319" end="00:02:56.560" style="s2">finance. [music] Another year, same</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.599" end="00:02:59.040" style="s2">kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.560" end="00:03:00.959" style="s2">Another new car. Honestly, Alex, how</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.040" end="00:03:02.640" style="s2">many does your father own now? Enough</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.959" end="00:03:05.440" style="s2">that he doesn&#39;t count them. Besides,</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.640" end="00:03:07.519" style="s2">this one&#39;s practically ordinary.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.440" end="00:03:09.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ordinary? That&#39;s worth more than my</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.519" end="00:03:12.480" style="s2">parents&#39; house. Then your parents need a</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.599" end="00:03:14.720" style="s2">better house. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.480" end="00:03:17.599" style="s2">Excuse me, gentlemen. Could I just get</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.720" end="00:03:20.000" style="s2">past, please? There&#39;s plenty of space.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.599" end="00:03:22.000" style="s2">Find another way around. You&#39;re standing</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.000" end="00:03:24.159" style="s2">in the middle of the corridor. Where</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.000" end="00:03:27.720" style="s2">exactly would you like me to go? Not my</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.159" end="00:03:27.720" style="s2">problem. Move.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.319" end="00:03:33.120" style="s2">Seriously, you had the entire corridor</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.799" end="00:03:34.959" style="s2">to walk through.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.120" end="00:03:37.519" style="s2">Watch your mouth. You should have moved</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.959" end="00:03:39.760" style="s2">when I told you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.519" end="00:03:40.959" style="s2">Funny. I thought university was for</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.760" end="00:03:42.400" style="s2">learning, [music] not teaching people</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.959" end="00:03:44.080" style="s2">how to</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.400" end="00:03:46.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; scholarship student, aren&#39;t you? I can</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.080" end="00:03:48.400" style="s2">tell by those cheap clothes. Really? I</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.879" end="00:03:50.720" style="s2">didn&#39;t realize my sweater was applying</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.400" end="00:03:54.000" style="s2">for admission. People like you should</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.720" end="00:03:56.400" style="s2">know your place at this university.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.000" end="00:03:58.080" style="s2">I do. Right here getting an education.</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.400" end="00:04:00.159" style="s2">My father&#39;s investments keep this</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.080" end="00:04:02.000" style="s2">university alive. [music] One phone call</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.159" end="00:04:03.200" style="s2">and your scholarship disappears. Does</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.000" end="00:04:05.439" style="s2">your father know you&#39;re threatening</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.200" end="00:04:07.360" style="s2">students with his money?</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.439" end="00:04:09.680" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t need to. I [music] can make</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.360" end="00:04:11.680" style="s2">things very difficult for you. Then</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.680" end="00:04:13.680" style="s2">you&#39;d better have a good reason.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.680" end="00:04:15.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen carefully. Next time you see me</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.680" end="00:04:16.959" style="s2">coming, you turn around and face that</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.120" end="00:04:18.479" style="s2">bloody wall. Are you serious? You want a</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.959" end="00:04:20.799" style="s2">grown man standing there staring at a</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.479" end="00:04:22.880" style="s2">wall because of you? Yes, because I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.799" end="00:04:24.400" style="s2">sick of looking at your face. Learn some</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.880" end="00:04:26.400" style="s2">respect and stay out of my way.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.400" end="00:04:28.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, your majesty. I&#39;ve just got</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.400" end="00:04:32.840" style="s2">Do I face the wall before you arrive or</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.479" end="00:04:32.840" style="s2">only when your ego enters the room?</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.199" end="00:04:39.120" style="s2">Shut up, Marcus.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.040" end="00:04:40.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you to take your hand off me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.120" end="00:04:43.120" style="s2">Don&#39;t ever put your hands on me again.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.880" end="00:04:45.520" style="s2">You&#39;ve got some nerve. Do you actually</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.120" end="00:04:47.600" style="s2">know what you&#39;ve just done? [music] Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.520" end="00:04:50.080" style="s2">I stopped you from bullying me, and I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.600" end="00:04:52.240" style="s2">do it again if I have to. Alex, enough.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.080" end="00:04:54.000" style="s2">Everyone&#39;s watching. Just leave. Enjoy</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.240" end="00:04:55.520" style="s2">your little victory, Cole. You&#39;ve just</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.000" end="00:04:57.280" style="s2">made the biggest mistake of your life</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.520" end="00:04:58.560" style="s2">because I wouldn&#39;t let you grab me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.280" end="00:05:01.199" style="s2">Listen to yourself. You sound</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.560" end="00:05:03.040" style="s2">ridiculous. My family has connections</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.199" end="00:05:04.400" style="s2">everywhere. You&#39;ll regret embarrassing</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.040" end="00:05:05.840" style="s2">me in front of these people. And perhaps</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.400" end="00:05:08.080" style="s2">you should stop giving them reasons to</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.840" end="00:05:09.680" style="s2">laugh. You know what&#39;s fascinating,</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.080" end="00:05:11.120" style="s2">Alexander? You keep telling everyone how</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.680" end="00:05:11.840" style="s2">powerful your father is. What have you</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.120" end="00:05:13.600" style="s2">actually achieved?</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.840" end="00:05:15.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You arrogant little nobody. You think</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.600" end="00:05:18.160" style="s2">you&#39;re better than me?</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.680" end="00:05:20.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I just don&#39;t need my father&#39;s name</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.160" end="00:05:21.759" style="s2">to tell me who I am. Enjoy your day,</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.320" end="00:05:24.160" style="s2">Alexander.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.759" end="00:05:25.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unbelievable. That scholarship, nobody</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.160" end="00:05:26.479" style="s2">just humiliated me in front of the</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.600" end="00:05:28.479" style="s2">entire corridor.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.479" end="00:05:29.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, Alex, you did grab him first. What</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.479" end="00:05:31.919" style="s2">did you expect him to do? I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.840" end="00:05:33.919" style="s2">remember asking for your bloody opinion.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.919" end="00:05:35.840" style="s2">All right, calm down. Making another</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.919" end="00:05:37.360" style="s2">scene won&#39;t help. That arrogant idiot</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.840" end="00:05:39.360" style="s2">thinks he can embarrass me and walk away</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.360" end="00:05:41.360" style="s2">laughing. He&#39;s going to regret it. Alex,</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.360" end="00:05:43.600" style="s2">he defended himself. If you keep pushing</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.360" end="00:05:45.440" style="s2">him, this could end badly. Don&#39;t lecture</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.600" end="00:05:47.360" style="s2">me. [music] I want him to understand</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.440" end="00:05:49.360" style="s2">exactly who he&#39;s dealing with. Just</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.360" end="00:05:52.360" style="s2">don&#39;t do something stupid. People</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.360" end="00:05:52.360" style="s2">already</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.600" end="00:05:57.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First day and I&#39;ve already made an</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.120" end="00:05:58.944" style="s2">enemy. That&#39;s quite an impressive start,</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.039" end="00:06:00.560" style="s2">Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.944" end="00:06:01.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.560" end="00:06:05.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, at least things can&#39;t get much</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.919" end="00:06:05.639" style="s2">more interesting than this.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.800" end="00:06:11.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hang on. Isn&#39;t that the boy who stood up</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.720" end="00:06:13.360" style="s2">to Alexander this morning? He looked</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.120" end="00:06:15.919" style="s2">perfectly fearless back there.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.360" end="00:06:17.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.919" end="00:06:18.960" style="s2">excuse me. Is this seat taken, or are</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.680" end="00:06:19.520" style="s2">you saving it for someone terribly</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.960" end="00:06:20.960" style="s2">important?</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.520" end="00:06:23.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not unless the chancellor is planning to</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.960" end="00:06:25.039" style="s2">join me, but I doubt she&#39;s got the time.</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.680" end="00:06:26.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, that&#39;s a relief. I was beginning</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.039" end="00:06:28.479" style="s2">to think every seat here came with an</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.479" end="00:06:30.240" style="s2">invitation. Not this one. Please sit</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.479" end="00:06:31.840" style="s2">down. I could use the company.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.240" end="00:06:33.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Olivia Bennett, by the way. And</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.840" end="00:06:34.400" style="s2">before you ask, no, I don&#39;t usually</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.440" end="00:06:36.080" style="s2">approach [music] strange men.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.400" end="00:06:37.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan Cole, and I promise I&#39;m only</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.080" end="00:06:38.160" style="s2">strange before I&#39;ve had my morning</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.280" end="00:06:40.000" style="s2">coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.160" end="00:06:41.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, Ethan Cole, you&#39;ve certainly made</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.000" end="00:06:44.479" style="s2">quite an entrance on your first day.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.919" end="00:06:44.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was hoping nobody noticed. Apparently,</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.479" end="00:06:47.120" style="s2">that</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.880" end="00:06:48.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw what happened with Alexander. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.120" end="00:06:49.680" style="s2">never seen anyone speak to him like that</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.880" end="00:06:51.759" style="s2">before.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.680" end="00:06:53.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? I thought I was being remarkably</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.759" end="00:06:55.120" style="s2">polite considering he nearly tore Mike</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.440" end="00:06:56.880" style="s2">off. You called out the most arrogant</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.120" end="00:06:57.919" style="s2">boy on campus and somehow you&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.880" end="00:06:59.759" style="s2">joking about it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.919" end="00:07:01.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, being frightened of him wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.759" end="00:07:03.599" style="s2">make</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.599" end="00:07:05.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan. Jokes aside, Alexander&#39;s father</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.599" end="00:07:06.000" style="s2">has enormous influence over this [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.120" end="00:07:08.240" style="s2">university.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.000" end="00:07:08.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand, but having powerful</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.240" end="00:07:10.720" style="s2">parents.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.960" end="00:07:12.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree. I&#39;m just worried he&#39;ll find a</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.720" end="00:07:15.360" style="s2">way to make your life difficult.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.880" end="00:07:16.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I appreciate that.</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.360" end="00:07:18.400" style="s2">Honestly, I&#39;m starting to feel sorry for</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.880" end="00:07:19.599" style="s2">Alexander. Imagine having all that money</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.400" end="00:07:20.400" style="s2">and still being [music] desperately</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.599" end="00:07:21.599" style="s2">short of manners.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.400" end="00:07:24.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, that&#39;s terrible. You&#39;re going to get</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.599" end="00:07:25.759" style="s2">yourself into so much trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.000" end="00:07:27.360" style="s2">probably. But at least I&#39;ll have an</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.759" end="00:07:28.880" style="s2">interesting story to tell.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.360" end="00:07:31.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a feeling you already have quite</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.880" end="00:07:32.400" style="s2">a few of those. That&#39;s the old finance</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.120" end="00:07:33.759" style="s2">building. Half the students are</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.400" end="00:07:34.319" style="s2">terrified of it, but I think it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.759" end="00:07:36.319" style="s2">beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.319" end="00:07:37.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beautiful. Absolutely. Although it does</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.319" end="00:07:38.479" style="s2">look like somewhere they&#39;d imprison</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.520" end="00:07:40.400" style="s2">deadlines.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.479" end="00:07:42.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, don&#39;t worry. The library is even</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.400" end="00:07:45.199" style="s2">more intimidating. You&#39;ll love it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.560" end="00:07:47.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wonderful. My university experience just</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.199" end="00:07:48.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I actually work evenings at a cafe near</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.039" end="00:07:50.319" style="s2">campus. Between shifts, lectures, and</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.960" end="00:07:50.720" style="s2">assignments, I barely get a moment to</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.319" end="00:07:52.160" style="s2">breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.720" end="00:07:54.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a lot to manage. Does it ever get</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.160" end="00:07:55.120" style="s2">overwhelming? But my parents work</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.080" end="00:07:56.319" style="s2">incredibly hard.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.120" end="00:07:57.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to make [music] something of this</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.319" end="00:07:58.240" style="s2">opportunity.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.120" end="00:07:59.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you&#39;re already doing something</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.240" end="00:08:01.599" style="s2">remarkable. Olivia,</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.919" end="00:08:03.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you&#39;re welcome to join me if you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.599" end="00:08:06.960" style="s2">too busy causing trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.520" end="00:08:08.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d love to join you. Wow. Okay, I take</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.960" end="00:08:09.759" style="s2">back everything [music] I said. This</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.240" end="00:08:11.759" style="s2">place is absolutely incredible.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.759" end="00:08:13.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. It&#39;s my favorite place on</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.759" end="00:08:15.759" style="s2">campus.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.599" end="00:08:17.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With this many books, I might need an</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.759" end="00:08:19.520" style="s2">entire year just to find the right one.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.680" end="00:08:21.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on then. Let&#39;s find you somewhere</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.520" end="00:08:23.045" style="s2">to. So, this is the investment analyst</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.520" end="00:08:24.240" style="s2">module. Apparently, Professor Ashford</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.045" end="00:08:25.520" style="s2">[music] expects us to understand all of</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.240" end="00:08:28.080" style="s2">this before the first assessment.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.520" end="00:08:30.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Discounted cash flows, risk adjustments.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.080" end="00:08:32.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Interesting. Most of us are already</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.560" end="00:08:33.839" style="s2">having nightmares about it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.240" end="00:08:35.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, let&#39;s see if we can make it a</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.839" end="00:08:36.719" style="s2">little less terrifying.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.200" end="00:08:38.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been staring at this question for</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.719" end="00:08:40.640" style="s2">20 minutes. Every time I calculate the</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.560" end="00:08:42.479" style="s2">value, the numbers refuse to make sense.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.640" end="00:08:43.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I have a look? Sometimes the problem</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.479" end="00:08:46.160" style="s2">isn&#39;t behind it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.919" end="00:08:48.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be my guest. But if you solve it in 30</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.160" end="00:08:50.880" style="s2">seconds, I might actually scream. Then</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.240" end="00:08:52.640" style="s2">I&#39;ll try to solve it quietly. Look here.</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.880" end="00:08:54.160" style="s2">They&#39;ve discounted the future cash flows</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.640" end="00:08:55.760" style="s2">correctly, but they&#39;ve ignored the</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.160" end="00:08:56.959" style="s2">additional risk. That&#39;s why the</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.760" end="00:08:58.720" style="s2">valuation [music] is inflated.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.959" end="00:09:00.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, you&#39;re right. That changes the</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.720" end="00:09:00.720" style="s2">entire result. How&#39;d you spot that so</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.320" end="00:09:01.920" style="s2">quickly? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.720" end="00:09:03.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just checked what the model was</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.920" end="00:09:05.600" style="s2">assuming before trusting the answer.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.200" end="00:09:07.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, that&#39;s brilliant. You I must</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.600" end="00:09:09.760" style="s2">admit, Ethan, I wasn&#39;t expecting my</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.519" end="00:09:11.839" style="s2">first day to be quite this interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.760" end="00:09:13.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither was I. Although meeting you has</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.839" end="00:09:15.360" style="s2">definitely improved it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.120" end="00:09:16.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, really? Careful. [music] Compliments</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.360" end="00:09:18.240" style="s2">like that might make me think you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.560" end="00:09:20.080" style="s2">charming. Well, I&#39;d hate to ruin my</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.240" end="00:09:21.760" style="s2">reputation already.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.080" end="00:09:23.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, let me buy you a coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.760" end="00:09:24.880" style="s2">Consider it a reward for surviving your</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.440" end="00:09:26.480" style="s2">first morning.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.880" end="00:09:28.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s very kind, but you really don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.480" end="00:09:30.320" style="s2">have to. I can get my own.</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.320" end="00:09:31.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, it&#39;s a coffee, not a marriage</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.320" end="00:09:32.560" style="s2">proposal. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.040" end="00:09:35.519" style="s2">Just let me do something nice.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.560" end="00:09:37.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, you&#39;ve convinced me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.519" end="00:09:38.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I ask you something? You don&#39;t seem</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.279" end="00:09:39.519" style="s2">remotely interested in impressing anyone</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.959" end="00:09:41.279" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.519" end="00:09:43.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why should I be? I&#39;d rather people know</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.279" end="00:09:44.880" style="s2">me for who I am than what I owned.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.120" end="00:09:46.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s refreshing. Most people here</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.880" end="00:09:46.880" style="s2">spend their lives trying to prove</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.160" end="00:09:48.320" style="s2">they&#39;re [music] important.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.880" end="00:09:50.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then they&#39;re probably missing the best</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.320" end="00:09:51.920" style="s2">parts of life.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.160" end="00:09:53.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got to be joking. Look at him.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.920" end="00:09:55.279" style="s2">He&#39;s already acting like he belongs</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.279" end="00:09:57.440" style="s2">here. He&#39;s having coffee with Olivia.</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.279" end="00:09:59.920" style="s2">Alex, that&#39;s hardly a criminal offense</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.440" end="00:10:01.519" style="s2">after humiliating me this morning. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.920" end="00:10:03.440" style="s2">sitting there laughing as if nothing</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.519" end="00:10:05.600" style="s2">happened.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.440" end="00:10:08.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $30 billion. An extraordinary</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.600" end="00:10:10.160" style="s2">opportunity. The trustees are [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.000" end="00:10:13.120" style="s2">expecting certainty, but finance has</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.160" end="00:10:14.880" style="s2">never been about certainty. Right. Time</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.120" end="00:10:17.279" style="s2">to see whether these students understand</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.880" end="00:10:18.959" style="s2">the risks as well as the rewards.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.279" end="00:10:20.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, there are two seats just over</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.959" end="00:10:22.480" style="s2">there. We should get settled before</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.640" end="00:10:24.320" style="s2">Professor Ashford arrives.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.480" end="00:10:25.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is quite a place. They certainly</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.320" end="00:10:25.920" style="s2">know how to make a finance lecture</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.519" end="00:10:27.497" style="s2">looking</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.920" end="00:10:28.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait until you meet Ashford. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.497" end="00:10:30.640" style="s2">[music] brilliant, but he doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.640" end="00:10:34.079" style="s2">tolerate anyone coming unprepared.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.640" end="00:10:37.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. I was hoping someone here Okanide</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.079" end="00:10:39.519" style="s2">$30 billion on the table. A partnership</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.040" end="00:10:41.907" style="s2">that could transform this university,</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.519" end="00:10:44.320" style="s2">but a large investment. The figures</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.907" end="00:10:45.920" style="s2">[music] must justify the confidence.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.320" end="00:10:48.079" style="s2">Margaret, you&#39;d tell me I&#39;m working too</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.920" end="00:10:49.680" style="s2">hard again. Good morning, everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.079" end="00:10:51.519" style="s2">Welcome to Advanced International</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.680" end="00:10:52.800" style="s2">Investment Analysis. I expect your</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.519" end="00:10:54.880" style="s2">attention, [music] not merely your</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.800" end="00:10:56.880" style="s2">attendance. Today, we&#39;re examining a</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.880" end="00:10:58.282" style="s2">major international partnership. The</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.880" end="00:10:59.279" style="s2">numbers are impressive, but I want</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.282" end="00:11:02.720" style="s2">[music] you thinking beyond the</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.279" end="00:11:04.560" style="s2">headlines. Remember this. Alex, we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.720" end="00:11:06.480" style="s2">late. Could you at least try not to make</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.560" end="00:11:09.040" style="s2">an entrance?</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.480" end="00:11:10.320" style="s2">Relax, Marcus. It&#39;s 5 minutes. I&#39;m sure</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.040" end="00:11:12.240" style="s2">the university without me. Well,</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.320" end="00:11:15.200" style="s2">everyone seems to have noticed,</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.240" end="00:11:16.640" style="s2">including the professor. Good. Then at</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.200" end="00:11:19.360" style="s2">least he knows I&#39;ve arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.640" end="00:11:21.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Witmore, how very generous of you to</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.360" end="00:11:22.000" style="s2">join us. Shall we begin again for your</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.200" end="00:11:23.680" style="s2">benefit?</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.000" end="00:11:24.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apologies, professor. There was a bit of</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.680" end="00:11:26.800" style="s2">traffic on the way in.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.880" end="00:11:28.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remarkable traffic inside a UNIF</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.800" end="00:11:29.920" style="s2">corridor. That really is a problem worth</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.320" end="00:11:31.920" style="s2">investigating. Take your seat, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.920" end="00:11:33.680" style="s2">Whitmore. We have work to Ladies and</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.920" end="00:11:35.839" style="s2">gentlemen, West Bridge is considering a</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.680" end="00:11:37.600" style="s2">$30 billion partnership with the Okan</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.839" end="00:11:39.279" style="s2">Ride Consortium. an opportunity of</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.600" end="00:11:41.120" style="s2">extraordinary scale, but [music] that</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.279" end="00:11:43.279" style="s2">your responsibility is to test the</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.120" end="00:11:45.600" style="s2">assumptions, question the projections,</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.279" end="00:11:46.480" style="s2">and [music] understand the risk. That is</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.600" end="00:11:48.000" style="s2">real investment.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.480" end="00:11:49.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Professor, perhaps you should mention</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.000" end="00:11:51.440" style="s2">that my father helped make this</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.360" end="00:11:52.399" style="s2">partnership possible. Whitmore Capital</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.440" end="00:11:53.680" style="s2">has the connections to bring</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.399" end="00:11:55.519" style="s2">opportunities like this to West</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.680" end="00:11:58.160" style="s2">Brbridge. Well, you can&#39;t argue with</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.519" end="00:12:00.000" style="s2">that. It&#39;s certainly a massive deal.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.160" end="00:12:01.760" style="s2">Exactly. [music] Some of us actually</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.000" end="00:12:03.680" style="s2">understand how the world works.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.760" end="00:12:05.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mr. Whitmore. Your father&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.680" end="00:12:07.200" style="s2">business achievements are impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.440" end="00:12:08.720" style="s2">Unfortunately, I don&#39;t recall awarding</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.200" end="00:12:10.399" style="s2">you academic credit for them.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.720" end="00:12:12.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was simply pointing out, professor,</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.399" end="00:12:13.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and I&#39;m pointing out that inherited</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.000" end="00:12:16.480" style="s2">influence is not the same thing as</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.839" end="00:12:17.839" style="s2">understanding an investment.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.480" end="00:12:19.760" style="s2">Now, look carefully at [music] this</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.839" end="00:12:22.880" style="s2">valuation. The projected enterprise</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.760" end="00:12:25.279" style="s2">value is approximately $30 billion.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.880" end="00:12:26.708" style="s2">We&#39;ve incorporated future cash flows.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.279" end="00:12:28.880" style="s2">But what happens if one assumption</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.708" end="00:12:30.959" style="s2">[music] is wrong? I don&#39;t want anyone</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.880" end="00:12:32.240" style="s2">repeating the answer.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.959" end="00:12:33.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on. That doesn&#39;t [music] look</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.240" end="00:12:35.600" style="s2">right. Something&#39;s wrong with the</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.760" end="00:12:37.040" style="s2">assumptions. What do you mean? The</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.600" end="00:12:38.320" style="s2">professor&#39;s been explaining that model</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.040" end="00:12:41.040" style="s2">for the past 10 minutes. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.320" end="00:12:42.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, but the currency adjustment and</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.040" end="00:12:46.000" style="s2">terminal value don&#39;t seem consistent.</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.959" end="00:12:48.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me check something.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.000" end="00:12:49.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re recalculating the entire model,</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.480" end="00:12:51.279" style="s2">Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.519" end="00:12:52.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once the risk and currency adjustment</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.279" end="00:12:53.440" style="s2">system, [music] the result changes</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.639" end="00:12:55.040" style="s2">completely.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.440" end="00:12:57.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, are you saying the investment</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.040" end="00:12:59.200" style="s2">could actually lose money?</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.440" end="00:13:01.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly what I&#39;m saying. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.200" end="00:13:03.040" style="s2">And it&#39;s not a small error.</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.519" end="00:13:04.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, are you really going to challenge</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.040" end="00:13:04.880" style="s2">Professor Ashford [music] on his own</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.240" end="00:13:06.399" style="s2">valuation?</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.880" end="00:13:07.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If there&#39;s a serious error, somebody</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.399" end="00:13:08.720" style="s2">needs to point it out. That&#39;s what we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.680" end="00:13:11.440" style="s2">here to learn.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.720" end="00:13:12.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, the gentleman in the Navy sweater.</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.440" end="00:13:14.399" style="s2">You have a question?</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.959" end="00:13:16.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, [music] professor. It&#39;s about the</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.399" end="00:13:18.399" style="s2">valuation assumption.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.399" end="00:13:20.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, this is brilliant. The scholarship</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.399" end="00:13:22.079" style="s2">boy thinks he $30 billion investment.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.160" end="00:13:23.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, will you stop? At least let</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.079" end="00:13:25.519" style="s2">him explain what he&#39;s found.</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.519" end="00:13:27.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Explain what? He probably doesn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.519" end="00:13:29.440" style="s2">understand the numbers on that screen.</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.600" end="00:13:30.800" style="s2">Professor, with respect, I believe</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.440" end="00:13:32.480" style="s2">there&#39;s a significant error in the</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.800" end="00:13:34.320" style="s2">investment valuation you&#39;ve presented.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.480" end="00:13:35.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An error, Mr. Cole. That&#39;s a serious</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.320" end="00:13:37.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which part of the model concerns you?</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.920" end="00:13:39.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The currency adjustments [music] and</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.360" end="00:13:40.800" style="s2">terminal value assumptions. They&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.120" end="00:13:41.200" style="s2">overstating the investment&#39;s economic</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.800" end="00:13:43.120" style="s2">value.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.200" end="00:13:44.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you believe you&#39;ve identified some.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.120" end="00:13:46.399" style="s2">Mr. Cole, you&#39;re challenging a model</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.720" end="00:13:48.000" style="s2">prepared by experienced financial</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.399" end="00:13:48.880" style="s2">analysts. I hope you understand the</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.000" end="00:13:50.160" style="s2">seriousness of that</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.880" end="00:13:51.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; instead of simply accepting the</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.160" end="00:13:52.480" style="s2">conclusion.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.040" end="00:13:54.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very well. [music] If you&#39;re so</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.480" end="00:13:56.160" style="s2">confident, I want you to demonstrate</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.000" end="00:13:57.920" style="s2">your reasoning before this entire class.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.160" end="00:13:59.360" style="s2">Gladly, professor.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.920" end="00:14:00.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come forward, [music] Mr. Cole. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.360" end="00:14:02.240" style="s2">see whether your calculations can</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.639" end="00:14:03.600" style="s2">support that remarkable claim.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.240" end="00:14:05.600" style="s2">Certainly, professor. I&#39;ll start with</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.600" end="00:14:07.279" style="s2">the assumptions behind the valuation.</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.600" end="00:14:10.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, Ethan. [music] Show them what</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.279" end="00:14:12.720" style="s2">you found.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.000" end="00:14:15.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very well. You have the floor. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.720" end="00:14:17.360" style="s2">make this interesting, Cole. I&#39;m certain</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.040" end="00:14:19.199" style="s2">your answer is wrong. If you&#39;re right,</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.360" end="00:14:21.360" style="s2">I&#39;ll lie down and let you step over me</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.199" end="00:14:24.959" style="s2">three times. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.360" end="00:14:29.040" style="s2">That&#39;s quite a promise, Alex.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.959" end="00:14:30.880" style="s2">One I&#39;m certain I won&#39;t need to keep.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.040" end="00:14:32.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, that&#39;s a very generous offer.</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.880" end="00:14:33.600" style="s2">Are you absolutely certain?</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.000" end="00:14:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Completely certain. You haven&#39;t got a</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.600" end="00:14:37.040" style="s2">chance, Cole. Not against this model.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.600" end="00:14:38.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, I wasn&#39;t planning to walk over</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.040" end="00:14:41.279" style="s2">anyone today,</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.880" end="00:14:43.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; but since you insist, I accept.</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.279" end="00:14:44.880" style="s2">Brilliant. Here&#39;s the first problem. The</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.199" end="00:14:45.920" style="s2">model converts projected revenue using</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.880" end="00:14:47.519" style="s2">one exchange rate [music] assumption,</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.920" end="00:14:48.959" style="s2">but discounts it using another. Those</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.519" end="00:14:50.800" style="s2">adjustments to the international risk</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.959" end="00:14:52.120" style="s2">model, Mr. Cole. The same currency</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.800" end="00:14:54.000" style="s2">exposure is being treated differently</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.120" end="00:14:55.839" style="s2">[music] in two parts of the valuation.</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.000" end="00:14:57.360" style="s2">Interesting. Show me. Now look at the</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.839" end="00:14:58.720" style="s2">inflation assumptions. [music] The cash</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.360" end="00:15:00.240" style="s2">flows are adjusted one way, but the</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.720" end="00:15:01.760" style="s2">terminal value uses a different basis.</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.240" end="00:15:02.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re suggesting the terminal visated</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.760" end="00:15:03.519" style="s2">because those assumptions aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.800" end="00:15:05.519" style="s2">aligned. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.519" end="00:15:07.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Correct both errors and the</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.519" end="00:15:09.150" style="s2">projected value falls dramatically.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.279" end="00:15:11.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The original conclusion no longer holds.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.150" end="00:15:13.519" style="s2">[music] Good heavens.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.839" end="00:15:15.519" style="s2">The currency adjustment changes the</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.519" end="00:15:16.959" style="s2">discounting and the terminal value app.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.519" end="00:15:18.720" style="s2">And once they&#39;re corrected together, the</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.959" end="00:15:20.639" style="s2">investment looks very different.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.720" end="00:15:22.250" style="s2">Extraordinary. You&#39;ve identified an</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.639" end="00:15:23.760" style="s2">inconsistency that our review team</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.250" end="00:15:25.440" style="s2">[music] failed to challenge. The numbers</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.760" end="00:15:27.760" style="s2">were there, professor. They just</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.440" end="00:15:29.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cole, I owe you an apology. Your</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.760" end="00:15:30.639" style="s2">analysis is correct, and [music] you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.120" end="00:15:32.000" style="s2">demonstrated exceptionally well. Thank</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.639" end="00:15:33.385" style="s2">you, professor. I appreciate you giving</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.000" end="00:15:34.880" style="s2">me the opportunity to explain it. An</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.385" end="00:15:36.720" style="s2">[music] excellent piece of financial</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.880" end="00:15:38.240" style="s2">reasoning. This is precisely the</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.720" end="00:15:39.440" style="s2">critical thinking I expect at West.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.240" end="00:15:42.320" style="s2">Thank you, sir. [music] That means a</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.440" end="00:15:44.000" style="s2">great deal. Well, Alex, you did promise</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.320" end="00:15:44.320" style="s2">three times, wasn&#39;t it? We all heard</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.000" end="00:15:46.240" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.320" end="00:15:47.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, shut up, Marcus. IT WAS A BLOODY</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.240" end="00:15:49.360" style="s2">JOKE. I&#39;M NOT LYING on the floor for</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.680" end="00:15:50.880" style="s2">that nobody.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.360" end="00:15:52.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sounded pretty serious when you made</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.880" end="00:15:54.959" style="s2">the bet. Now, suddenly, it&#39;s a joke. I</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.800" end="00:15:56.000" style="s2">said I&#39;m not doing it. End of</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.959" end="00:15:58.079" style="s2">discussion.</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.000" end="00:15:59.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax, Alexander. I wouldn&#39;t dream of</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.079" end="00:16:02.000" style="s2">asking you to lie on the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.920" end="00:16:03.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good, because I wasn&#39;t going to do it</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.000" end="00:16:05.360" style="s2">regardless of what you said. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.519" end="00:16:07.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. It&#39;s just fascinating how</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.360" end="00:16:09.199" style="s2">quickly a man&#39;s promises disappear when</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.120" end="00:16:11.199" style="s2">his confidence does. You think you&#39;re so</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.199" end="00:16:12.959" style="s2">clever, don&#39;t you, Cole? I cannot</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.199" end="00:16:14.639" style="s2">believe this. That arrogant little</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.959" end="00:16:16.560" style="s2">nobody has turned the entire university</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.639" end="00:16:17.759" style="s2">against me. Alex, forget it. You&#39;ve made</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.560" end="00:16:20.560" style="s2">your point. Just [music] let the whole</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.759" end="00:16:21.839" style="s2">thing go. Let it go. Absolutely not.</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.560" end="00:16:23.360" style="s2">Ethan Cole is going to regret</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.839" end="00:16:24.880" style="s2">humiliating me. Don&#39;t do anything</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.360" end="00:16:25.600" style="s2">reckless, Alex. This [music] has gone</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.880" end="00:16:28.240" style="s2">far enough.</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.600" end="00:16:29.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, that was You challenged Professor</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.240" end="00:16:30.160" style="s2">Ashford and proved him wrong in front of</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.759" end="00:16:31.839" style="s2">everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.160" end="00:16:32.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just followed the numbers. Honestly, I</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.839" end="00:16:34.240" style="s2">wasn&#39;t expecting him [music] to</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.639" end="00:16:36.079" style="s2">research, Captain.</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.240" end="00:16:37.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, you deserved it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.079" end="00:16:38.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Alexander&#39;s face when the professor</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.839" end="00:16:41.360" style="s2">confirmed your answer. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.959" end="00:16:43.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Priceless.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.360" end="00:16:44.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, I was wondering, are you doing</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.279" end="00:16:46.880" style="s2">anything this afternoon?</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.959" end="00:16:48.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apart from correcting another 30 billion</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.880" end="00:16:49.759" style="s2">is enough for today.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.399" end="00:16:50.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do you ask? There&#39;s [music] a</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.759" end="00:16:51.759" style="s2">beautiful lake just beyond these</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.959" end="00:16:53.199" style="s2">gardens.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.759" end="00:16:55.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought perhaps we could take a walk</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.199" end="00:16:58.000" style="s2">together. I&#39;d really like that. Olivia.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.839" end="00:16:59.519" style="s2">Wow. I&#39;ve been here less than a day and</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.000" end="00:17:00.560" style="s2">somehow nobody mentioned the university</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.519" end="00:17:02.240" style="s2">had a place like this.</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.560" end="00:17:04.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s my favorite escape. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.240" end="00:17:06.799" style="s2">Whenever everything gets overworld,</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.079" end="00:17:08.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can see why. It&#39;s peaceful and the</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.799" end="00:17:10.319" style="s2">company makes it even better.</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.799" end="00:17:13.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful, [music] Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.319" end="00:17:15.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well, Olivia Bennett. I wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.039" end="00:17:17.039" style="s2">expecting to find you out here. And</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.120" end="00:17:19.919" style="s2">who&#39;s that she&#39;s with? I don&#39;t remember</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.039" end="00:17:21.520" style="s2">seeing him around before. Interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.919" end="00:17:23.280" style="s2">She seems rather comfortable with him,</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.520" end="00:17:26.799" style="s2">doesn&#39;t she?</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.280" end="00:17:28.559" style="s2">Perhaps it&#39;s time I introduce myself.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.799" end="00:17:29.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Olivia, pleasant surprise. I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.559" end="00:17:30.320" style="s2">expect to find you enjoying the lake</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.840" end="00:17:32.320" style="s2">this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.320" end="00:17:33.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Sebastian. Hello. I didn&#39;t realize</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.320" end="00:17:35.840" style="s2">you were around.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.600" end="00:17:37.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, I&#39;m certainly glad I found you. I</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.840" end="00:17:40.320" style="s2">was hoping we&#39;d have a chance to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.679" end="00:17:42.960" style="s2">Hello. I&#39;m Ethan Cole. And you are</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.320" end="00:17:44.880" style="s2">Sebastian Vale. Olivia and I have known</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.960" end="00:17:46.799" style="s2">each other for quite some time.</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.880" end="00:17:48.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Sebastian. [music] We met at a</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.799" end="00:17:50.320" style="s2">university reception.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.640" end="00:17:52.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One of the more memorable evenings,</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.320" end="00:17:56.000" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t you agree?</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.799" end="00:17:57.520" style="s2">Sounds like quite an occasion.</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.000" end="00:17:58.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Olivia, you&#39;re turning down my</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.520" end="00:18:01.039" style="s2">invitation to spend time with this</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.960" end="00:18:02.960" style="s2">fellow. Careful, Sebastian. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.039" end="00:18:05.440" style="s2">Olivia can decide whom she spends time</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.960" end="00:18:07.760" style="s2">with. And what exactly makes you so</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.440" end="00:18:09.840" style="s2">special, Mr. Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.760" end="00:18:12.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, that&#39;s enough. You&#39;re being</p>
