<p begin="00:18:12.720" end="00:18:15.919" style="s2">Ethan, shall we go?</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.799" end="00:18:18.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.919" end="00:18:21.440" style="s2">We were having a lovely afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.720" end="00:18:22.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Olivia, you&#39;re seriously walking away</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.440" end="00:18:25.919" style="s2">from me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.799" end="00:18:28.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Goodbye, Sebastian.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.919" end="00:18:30.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Sebastian. I need you to deal with</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.080" end="00:18:32.880" style="s2">an unpleasant situation. His name is</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.640" end="00:18:35.679" style="s2">Ethan Cole. He&#39;s a student here at West</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.880" end="00:18:36.799" style="s2">Brbridge.</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.679" end="00:18:40.640" style="s2">Make it clear he should stay [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.799" end="00:18:43.840" style="s2">away from Olivia tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.640" end="00:18:45.760" style="s2">Sebastian sent the details. Ethan Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.840" end="00:18:49.120" style="s2">Apparently, he&#39;s causing trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.760" end="00:18:50.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All this over a university student.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.120" end="00:18:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what we&#39;re being paid to sort</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.480" end="00:18:56.240" style="s2">out. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.720" end="00:18:58.000" style="s2">Then we&#39;d better find him.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.240" end="00:18:59.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, that was certainly an unexpected</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.000" end="00:19:01.120" style="s2">end to our peaceful afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.840" end="00:19:02.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re telling [music] me. Does</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.120" end="00:19:04.640" style="s2">Sebastian always make such dramatic</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.720" end="00:19:06.640" style="s2">entrances? [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.640" end="00:19:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unfortunately, he does enjoy being the</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.640" end="00:19:09.840" style="s2">center of attention.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.400" end="00:19:11.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s hope the rest of our walk is</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.840" end="00:19:15.919" style="s2">quieter.</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.840" end="00:19:19.679" style="s2">Ethan Cole, we&#39;ve been looking for you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.919" end="00:19:22.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You found me. What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.679" end="00:19:26.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, [music] do you know these men?</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.080" end="00:19:29.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, but I&#39;m about to find out. Listen</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.240" end="00:19:30.240" style="s2">carefully, Cole. Stay away from Olivia</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.039" end="00:19:32.320" style="s2">Bennett. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.240" end="00:19:34.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who exactly sent you to deliver that</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.320" end="00:19:37.440" style="s2">message.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.480" end="00:19:39.013" style="s2">You&#39;re asking too many questions, mate.</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.440" end="00:19:41.033" style="s2">Then you&#39;ve come to the wrong person.</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.013" end="00:19:41.033" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.840" end="00:19:49.039" style="s2">I told you I don&#39;t want trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.960" end="00:19:52.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, please be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.039" end="00:19:54.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s quicker than he looks.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.400" end="00:19:56.240" style="s2">How did you move that quickly? Stay</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.160" end="00:19:59.679" style="s2">where you are. This doesn&#39;t need to go</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.240" end="00:20:01.600" style="s2">any further. Unbelievable. I gave you</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.679" end="00:20:04.558" style="s2">one simple job.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.600" end="00:20:05.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sebastian, you sent these men after us.</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.558" end="00:20:07.679" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.280" end="00:20:09.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, this was your idea?</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.679" end="00:20:11.200" style="s2">I should have known.</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.679" end="00:20:13.200" style="s2">You should have stayed out of my way,</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.200" end="00:20:15.520" style="s2">Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.200" end="00:20:18.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What have you done? You have no idea who</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.520" end="00:20:20.799" style="s2">you&#39;re dealing with. Enough, Sebastian.</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.400" end="00:20:23.520" style="s2">This ends right here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.799" end="00:20:24.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Security. We need help on the garden</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.520" end="00:20:27.679" style="s2">path.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.400" end="00:20:30.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Olivia, wait. Don&#39;t do this.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.679" end="00:20:32.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, I was so frightened. I thought</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.480" end="00:20:34.240" style="s2">something terrible might happen.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.080" end="00:20:36.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, it&#39;s over now. You&#39;re safe. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.240" end="00:20:38.400" style="s2">what matters.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.480" end="00:20:40.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. I don&#39;t know [music] what I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.400" end="00:20:42.400" style="s2">have done without you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.000" end="00:20:44.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to thank me, Olivia.</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.400" end="00:20:46.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you won&#39;t believe what happened at</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.320" end="00:20:48.400" style="s2">the university today. That Ethan [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.640" end="00:20:51.200" style="s2">Cole embarrassed me and took the</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.400" end="00:20:53.039" style="s2">research captain position.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.200" end="00:20:55.600" style="s2">You have influence over that investment</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.039" end="00:20:57.760" style="s2">program. Do something.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.600" end="00:21:00.320" style="s2">Yes, Dad. [music] I&#39;m listening.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.760" end="00:21:02.559" style="s2">Alexander, calm yourself. Start from the</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.320" end="00:21:03.919" style="s2">beginning. So, Professor Ashford</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.559" end="00:21:06.559" style="s2">appointed this Ethan [music] Cole</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.919" end="00:21:08.000" style="s2">instead of you. Whitmore Capital has</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.559" end="00:21:11.000" style="s2">considerable influence over that</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.000" end="00:21:11.000" style="s2">program.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.120" end="00:21:16.080" style="s2">Leave this matter to me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.240" end="00:21:19.360" style="s2">Whitmore Capital has withdrawn its</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.080" end="00:21:22.960" style="s2">support. This cannot be right. The</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.360" end="00:21:27.080" style="s2">entire Oakan we&#39;ve worked for.</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.960" end="00:21:27.080" style="s2">Why would Richard do this?</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.280" end="00:21:32.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $30 billion. Henry, do you understand</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.480" end="00:21:34.240" style="s2">what we&#39;ve just lost?</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.720" end="00:21:36.720" style="s2">Richard [music] Whitmore&#39;s decision was</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.240" end="00:21:39.200" style="s2">entirely unexpected.</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.720" end="00:21:42.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The entire research program is now in</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.200" end="00:21:42.200" style="s2">jeopardy.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.640" end="00:21:46.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, unless this crisis [music] is</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.799" end="00:21:48.320" style="s2">resolved, your position will be</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.799" end="00:21:50.480" style="s2">reviewed.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.320" end="00:21:52.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan earned that appointment. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.480" end="00:21:53.840" style="s2">I will not apologize for recognizing</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.480" end="00:21:55.919" style="s2">excellence.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.840" end="00:21:58.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I sincerely hope you can save this</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.919" end="00:22:00.799" style="s2">program.</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.320" end="00:22:03.120" style="s2">Henry, darling, something&#39;s troubling</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.799" end="00:22:04.720" style="s2">you. What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.120" end="00:22:07.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing you need to worry about, my</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.720" end="00:22:09.919" style="s2">love.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.039" end="00:22:13.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After 30 years, you still can&#39;t hide</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.919" end="00:22:13.480" style="s2">things from me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.480" end="00:22:22.760" style="s2">How am I supposed to afford all this?</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.720" end="00:22:22.760" style="s2">And now I could lose everything.</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.200" end="00:22:28.320" style="s2">Margaret needs me. I cannot let her</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.080" end="00:22:30.159" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.320" end="00:22:32.320" style="s2">Professor [music] Ashford, are you all</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.159" end="00:22:34.480" style="s2">right? You look exhausted.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.320" end="00:22:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a difficult morning, Mr. Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.480" end="00:22:37.200" style="s2">Nothing more.</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.000" end="00:22:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard about [music] the investment</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.200" end="00:22:42.480" style="s2">withdrawal. Perhaps I can help.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.480" end="00:22:44.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d better come into my office.</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.480" end="00:22:46.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Professor,</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.000" end="00:22:48.400" style="s2">what if I could arrange $500 billion for</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.559" end="00:22:50.480" style="s2">this university?</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.400" end="00:22:52.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $500 [music] billion?</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.480" end="00:22:55.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A 10-year investment commitment,</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.480" end="00:22:58.000" style="s2">education, infrastructure, and research.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.440" end="00:23:00.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cole, surely.</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.000" end="00:23:02.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you mocking me, Mr. Cole? This is a</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.720" end="00:23:04.000" style="s2">serious crisis,</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.320" end="00:23:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; professor. I would never make light of</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.000" end="00:23:10.320" style="s2">your situation. Then please understand</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.520" end="00:23:13.840" style="s2">this isn&#39;t a classroom exercise.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.320" end="00:23:15.200" style="s2">Give me a little time. You&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.840" end="00:23:17.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charles, I need you to prepare an</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.200" end="00:23:20.000" style="s2">institutional investment proposal. West</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.679" end="00:23:22.480" style="s2">Brbridge Crown University, $500 [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.000" end="00:23:24.720" style="s2">billion over 10 years. Coordinate the</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.480" end="00:23:27.039" style="s2">approvals immediately. Professor</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.720" end="00:23:28.880" style="s2">Ashford&#39;s [music] program is a priority</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.039" end="00:23:30.880" style="s2">and</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.880" end="00:23:32.880" style="s2">500 billion, sir. That&#39;s an</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.880" end="00:23:34.960" style="s2">extraordinary commitment.</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.880" end="00:23:36.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Charles. Structure it through the</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.960" end="00:23:38.559" style="s2">foundation.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.880" end="00:23:40.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll coordinate with legal and the</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.559" end="00:23:40.400" style="s2">investment committee immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.056" end="00:23:43.200" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.400" end="00:23:44.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excellent. Keep me informed.</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.200" end="00:23:46.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The foundation&#39;s legal team is preparing</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.960" end="00:23:48.559" style="s2">the 10-year commitment.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.880" end="00:23:51.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Include 2 billion separately for</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.559" end="00:23:53.840" style="s2">Ashford&#39;s research.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.679" end="00:23:55.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood, sir. will handle everything</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.840" end="00:23:58.559" style="s2">discreetly.</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.440" end="00:24:01.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Charles. Proceed.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.559" end="00:24:06.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sterling Global Foundation. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.760" end="00:24:08.799" style="s2">$500 billion over 10 years. Good</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.480" end="00:24:11.760" style="s2">heavens. This could [music] transform</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.799" end="00:24:13.919" style="s2">the entire university. We must convene</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.760" end="00:24:15.426" style="s2">the council in Ladies and gentlemen,</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.919" end="00:24:15.520" style="s2">Sterling Global has committed</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.426" end="00:24:18.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.520" end="00:24:21.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $500 billion over 10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.080" end="00:24:23.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 billion? Are you absolutely certain?</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.360" end="00:24:28.000" style="s2">The agreement [music] is authorized,</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.039" end="00:24:31.279" style="s2">Henry. Our university is saved.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.000" end="00:24:33.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 billion. Exactly the amount you</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.279" end="00:24:36.559" style="s2">promised me. I&#39;m glad everything one</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.600" end="00:24:40.240" style="s2">worked out, Professor.</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.559" end="00:24:41.760" style="s2">Who exactly are you, Ethan Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.240" end="00:24:43.200" style="s2">Someone who believes good people [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.760" end="00:24:46.080" style="s2">deserve a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.200" end="00:24:47.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 billion. You can thank my father for</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.080" end="00:24:49.600" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.520" end="00:24:52.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father arranged the Sterling Global</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.600" end="00:24:55.120" style="s2">Investment. Obviously.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.640" end="00:24:58.080" style="s2">Who else has that kind of influence?</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.120" end="00:25:00.799" style="s2">That&#39;s not quite what I heard, Alex. Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.080" end="00:25:03.600" style="s2">Whitmore, I suggest you stop misleading</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.799" end="00:25:06.080" style="s2">these students. Misleading them? My</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.600" end="00:25:07.840" style="s2">father practically owns this university.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.080" end="00:25:10.960" style="s2">Your father withdrew his support.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.840" end="00:25:13.279" style="s2">Sterling Global saved this institution.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.960" end="00:25:14.559" style="s2">Is that what you think, Professor?</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.279" end="00:25:16.159" style="s2">Perhaps you should worry about your</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.559" end="00:25:17.440" style="s2">wife&#39;s hospital bills instead.</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.159" end="00:25:19.360" style="s2">Professor, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.440" end="00:25:22.320" style="s2">my family&#39;s circumstances are none of</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.360" end="00:25:24.000" style="s2">your concern, Mr. for Whitmore.</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.320" end="00:25:27.720" style="s2">Money seems to be everyone&#39;s [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.000" end="00:25:27.720" style="s2">concern these days.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.720" end="00:25:32.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, what&#39;s happened? You look</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.400" end="00:25:34.320" style="s2">terribly serious.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.640" end="00:25:36.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone needs to take responsibility for</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.320" end="00:25:37.679" style="s2">their actions.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.480" end="00:25:40.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you&#39;re going to do something about</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.679" end="00:25:40.679" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.960" end="00:25:43.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sometimes the truth simply needs to</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.640" end="00:25:45.760" style="s2">come.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.520" end="00:25:46.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I&#39;m rather busy. Can I call you</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.760" end="00:25:48.159" style="s2">later?</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.720" end="00:25:49.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, our investors are</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.159" end="00:25:51.200" style="s2">withdrawing. We&#39;re facing [music] a</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.360" end="00:25:52.880" style="s2">serious compliance investigation.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.200" end="00:25:55.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.880" end="00:25:58.640" style="s2">Dad, what are you talking [music] about?</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.760" end="00:26:00.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re in serious trouble, son.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.640" end="00:26:03.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three major investors have withdrawn</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.480" end="00:26:04.720" style="s2">already. How did this happen?</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.440" end="00:26:07.039" style="s2">What do you mean? They&#39;ve obtained our</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.720" end="00:26:09.279" style="s2">compliance [music] records. Contact the</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.039" end="00:26:12.000" style="s2">board immediately. We cannot afford</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.279" end="00:26:14.240" style="s2">another withdrawal.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.000" end="00:26:15.919" style="s2">Dad, tell them everything is under</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.240" end="00:26:18.320" style="s2">control.</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.919" end="00:26:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing is under control. Investors have</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.320" end="00:26:21.360" style="s2">suspended their commitments. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.000" end="00:26:25.120" style="s2">facing serious scrutiny.</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.360" end="00:26:28.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you&#39;re on loudspeaker.</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.120" end="00:26:30.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then turn it off, Alexander.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.480" end="00:26:32.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alex, you said your father arranged the</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.480" end="00:26:35.360" style="s2">investment.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.240" end="00:26:38.320" style="s2">Marcus, this is none of your business.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.360" end="00:26:40.159" style="s2">Go on, Cole. Enjoy your little victory.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.320" end="00:26:42.159" style="s2">Money can buy you an expensive jacket,</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.159" end="00:26:45.480" style="s2">Alexander. Unfortunately, character</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.159" end="00:26:45.480" style="s2">isn&#39;t included.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.760" end="00:26:50.063" style="s2">Remember that.</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.043" end="00:26:50.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.120" end="00:26:55.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You stood beside me when everything</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.799" end="00:26:56.960" style="s2">seemed lost. Thank you, Ethan. You</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.360" end="00:26:59.520" style="s2">believed in me [music] first, Professor.</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.960" end="00:27:01.440" style="s2">I haven&#39;t forgotten.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.520" end="00:27:04.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The university could use more people</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.440" end="00:27:04.919" style="s2">like you both.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.159" end="00:27:09.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Life certainly hasn&#39;t been boring since</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.919" end="00:27:12.159" style="s2">I met you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.679" end="00:27:14.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should I apologize or take that as a</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.159" end="00:27:16.080" style="s2">compliment?</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.240" end="00:27:17.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Definitely a compliment. [music] I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.080" end="00:27:21.480" style="s2">rather glad you came here.</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.919" end="00:27:21.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So am I. Olivia</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.559" end="00:27:25.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, would you like to meet my</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.000" end="00:27:27.440" style="s2">parents?</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.360" end="00:27:29.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meeting the parents already? Should I be</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.440" end="00:27:32.880" style="s2">nervous? [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.760" end="00:27:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only if you dislike my mother&#39;s cooking.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.880" end="00:27:38.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d love to meet them.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.000" end="00:27:40.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, here we are. Nothing particularly</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.880" end="00:27:42.080" style="s2">grand.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.159" end="00:27:44.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s beautiful, Olivia. It actually</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.080" end="00:27:47.600" style="s2">feels like home.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.159" end="00:27:50.960" style="s2">Mom&#39;s going to absolutely love those.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.600" end="00:27:53.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s hope your father likes me, too.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.960" end="00:27:55.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you&#39;re Ethan. We&#39;ve heard quite a</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.279" end="00:27:58.320" style="s2">lot about you. Hopefully, nothing too</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.200" end="00:28:00.880" style="s2">terrible, sir. It&#39;s lovely meeting you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.320" end="00:28:03.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, these are beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.880" end="00:28:06.000" style="s2">Thank you, Ethan. See, I told you they&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.840" end="00:28:08.640" style="s2">like you. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.000" end="00:28:09.264" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, Ethan, are you enjoying life here in</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.640" end="00:28:09.600" style="s2">England?</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.264" end="00:28:12.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.600" end="00:28:15.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; very much, especially since I met your</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.080" end="00:28:18.080" style="s2">daughter. Forgive me, Ethan. You look</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.760" end="00:28:21.200" style="s2">remarkably familiar.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.080" end="00:28:23.520" style="s2">Perhaps we&#39;ve crossed paths somewhere. I</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.200" end="00:28:27.279" style="s2">remember you now. The Sterling Global</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.520" end="00:28:29.760" style="s2">Gala in London. You were at that event.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.279" end="00:28:32.960" style="s2">I worked [music] there. You&#39;re William</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.760" end="00:28:36.240" style="s2">Sterling&#39;s son, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.960" end="00:28:39.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir, I am.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.240" end="00:28:41.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your wealth doesn&#39;t concern me, Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.200" end="00:28:44.159" style="s2">My daughter&#39;s happiness does. I care</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.679" end="00:28:45.679" style="s2">about Olivia more than anything, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.159" end="00:28:48.799" style="s2">Then tell her the truth before she</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.679" end="00:28:51.600" style="s2">discovers it herself.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.799" end="00:28:53.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right. I will.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.600" end="00:28:55.520" style="s2">Olivia, you&#39;ve become the most important</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.760" end="00:28:57.200" style="s2">person [music] in my life.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.520" end="00:28:59.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was beginning to wonder when you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.200" end="00:29:01.760" style="s2">finally say that.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.440" end="00:29:05.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you, Olivia.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.760" end="00:29:05.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I love you, [music] Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.159" end="00:29:09.840" style="s2">How would you feel about spending a few</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.760" end="00:29:11.600" style="s2">days in New York?</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.840" end="00:29:13.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; New York?</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.600" end="00:29:16.159" style="s2">Are you serious? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.679" end="00:29:17.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely. I&#39;d really like you to meet</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.159" end="00:29:21.440" style="s2">my family.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.840" end="00:29:23.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. I&#39;d absolutely love to.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.440" end="00:29:24.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t believe we&#39;re actually in New</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.520" end="00:29:27.210" style="s2">York.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.880" end="00:29:28.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome to my side of the Atlantic.</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.210" end="00:29:33.080" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.640" end="00:29:33.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, [music] where are we going first?</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.120" end="00:29:39.655" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Home. Our ride should be waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.240" end="00:29:40.159" style="s2">Welcome back, sir. Everything is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.655" end="00:29:42.720" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.159" end="00:29:43.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan, is that Rolls-Royce waiting for</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.720" end="00:29:46.559" style="s2">us?</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.760" end="00:29:47.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apparently, my father arranged something</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.559" end="00:29:51.440" style="s2">comfortable. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.919" end="00:29:55.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Comfortable? It&#39;s a Rolls-Royce.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.440" end="00:29:57.520" style="s2">Ethan, whose house is this?</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.520" end="00:30:00.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My parents house.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.520" end="00:30:03.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whose house? Your parents. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.399" end="00:30:06.000" style="s2">You never mentioned anything like this.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.520" end="00:30:09.039" style="s2">There&#39;s something I need to explain.</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.000" end="00:30:10.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My darling boy, I&#39;ve missed you</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.039" end="00:30:14.000" style="s2">terribly.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.240" end="00:30:16.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi, Mom. [music] Dad, this is Olivia.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.000" end="00:30:18.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ethan Sterling. Was anything you told me</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.960" end="00:30:20.720" style="s2">actually true?</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.240" end="00:30:22.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My feelings for you were real. I promise</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.720" end="00:30:24.195" style="s2">you that.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.000" end="00:30:25.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t care about your money, Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.195" end="00:30:29.880" style="s2">[music] I trusted you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.679" end="00:30:29.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Olivia, I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.919" end="00:30:33.279" style="s2">Olivia, please don&#39;t let it end like</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.399" end="00:30:37.200" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.279" end="00:30:41.720" style="s2">I need time, Ethan. Please respect that.</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.200" end="00:30:41.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m [music] sorry. I truly am.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.960" end="00:30:50.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I think I&#39;ve lost her. Son, all our</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.440" end="00:30:52.799" style="s2">billions cannot buy [music] back</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.720" end="00:30:55.760" style="s2">someone&#39;s trust.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.799" end="00:30:58.480" style="s2">What am I supposed to do? I wanted you</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.760" end="00:31:00.320" style="s2">to love me for who I was, but I was</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.480" end="00:31:01.840" style="s2">wrong to hide the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.320" end="00:31:03.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already loved [music] you, Ethan. You</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.840" end="00:31:06.559" style="s2">never needed to pretend.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.440" end="00:31:10.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more secrets. I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.559" end="00:31:10.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s start again.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.559" end="00:31:13.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We actually made it. Can you [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.799" end="00:31:15.919" style="s2">believe it?</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.840" end="00:31:17.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After everything we&#39;ve survived.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.919" end="00:31:19.120" style="s2">Absolutely.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.906" end="00:31:22.000" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.120" end="00:31:25.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m [music] so proud of you, Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.000" end="00:31:27.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I&#39;m incredibly proud of you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.200" end="00:31:29.919" style="s2">Graduation day, Cole. Still haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.520" end="00:31:32.080" style="s2">managed to buy yourself a car. Nice</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.919" end="00:31:34.720" style="s2">cars, Alexander. Did they improve your</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.080" end="00:31:36.246" style="s2">grades? [music] Come on, Alex. Give it a</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.720" end="00:31:38.211" style="s2">rest.</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.246" end="00:31:40.000" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.211" end="00:31:42.399" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.000" end="00:31:44.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For outstanding academic achievement and</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.399" end="00:31:46.320" style="s2">exceptional leadership, [music] I</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.159" end="00:31:48.159" style="s2">present you with the Chancellor&#39;s Medal.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.320" end="00:31:51.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Chancellor. This is [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.159" end="00:31:51.880" style="s2">an incredible honor.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.360" end="00:31:59.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never measure [music] someone&#39;s worth by</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.039" end="00:32:01.792" style="s2">their bank account. Wealth may open</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.519" end="00:32:03.760" style="s2">doors, but character determines what</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.792" end="00:32:07.279" style="s2">[music] you do with them. Choose</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.760" end="00:32:11.000" style="s2">kindness. Choose courage. And never</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.279" end="00:32:11.000" style="s2">underestimate anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.617" end="00:32:13.637" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.240" end="00:32:19.477" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good heavens. Who on earth is arriving?</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.000" end="00:32:21.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone rather important, apparently.</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.477" end="00:32:21.497" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.440" end="00:32:33.200" style="s2">William, isn&#39;t this place absolutely</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.000" end="00:32:35.840" style="s2">beautiful?</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.200" end="00:32:37.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It certainly is. Now, [music] let&#39;s find</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.840" end="00:32:40.240" style="s2">our son.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.760" end="00:32:42.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, isn&#39;t that William Sterling?</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.240" end="00:32:44.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, son. You&#39;ve made the</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.640" end="00:32:47.039" style="s2">Sterling family proud.</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.960" end="00:32:50.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Dad. I&#39;m so glad you [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.039" end="00:32:53.120" style="s2">both came. No, that can&#39;t be possible.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.480" end="00:32:55.360" style="s2">Ethan is a Sterling. The university</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.120" end="00:32:57.760" style="s2">rescue, [music] the research funding, it</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.360" end="00:32:59.360" style="s2">was his family.</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.760" end="00:33:00.880" style="s2">All this time, I thought [music] he had</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.360" end="00:33:02.480" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.880" end="00:33:05.440" style="s2">Perhaps now you understand, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.480" end="00:33:07.440" style="s2">Whitmore. The university, my research,</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.440" end="00:33:09.919" style="s2">Margaret&#39;s [music] treatment. How can I</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.440" end="00:33:13.120" style="s2">ever thank you? Seeing Margaret recover</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.919" end="00:33:14.799" style="s2">is thanks enough, Professor.</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.120" end="00:33:17.760" style="s2">You&#39;re an extraordinary young man,</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.799" end="00:33:20.960" style="s2">Ethan. You deserve every opportunity,</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.760" end="00:33:24.480" style="s2">sir. Olivia Bennett, you loved me before</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.960" end="00:33:29.000" style="s2">you knew my name. Will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.480" end="00:33:29.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, of course I&#39;ll marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.200" end="00:33:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you so much,</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.760" end="00:33:38.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; my beautiful little girl. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.000" end="00:33:40.480" style="s2">Look at you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.159" end="00:33:42.240" style="s2">Today, we&#39;re gaining a wonderful</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.480" end="00:33:44.080" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.240" end="00:33:47.080" style="s2">I&#39;m so lucky to have both of [music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.080" end="00:33:47.080" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.440" end="00:33:55.279" style="s2">How does it feel to be Mrs. Sterling?</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.279" end="00:33:57.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wonderful. But you&#39;ll always [music] be</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.279" end="00:33:59.120" style="s2">my Ethan.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.600" end="00:34:01.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you&#39;ll always be my greatest</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.120" end="00:34:03.678" style="s2">blessing.</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.658" end="00:34:03.678" style="s2">[applause and music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.159" end="00:34:08.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman, the expansion strategy is</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.240" end="00:34:10.000" style="s2">ready for your approval.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.079" end="00:34:12.138" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Proceed, but make sure our education</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.000" end="00:34:14.159" style="s2">commitments remain fully funded. This a</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.138" end="00:34:18.119" style="s2">[music] member tier in the streak.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.159" end="00:34:18.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely, Mr. Sterling.</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.520" end="00:34:24.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling, I never thought university</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.919" end="00:34:25.893" style="s2">would be possible for me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.079" end="00:34:28.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work hard. Your future is yours to</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.893" end="00:34:30.639" style="s2">[music] build.</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.159" end="00:34:33.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And remember to help someone else along</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.639" end="00:34:33.879" style="s2">the way.</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.639" end="00:34:40.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy. Daddy. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.320" end="00:34:41.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s my beautiful little princess.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.958" end="00:34:43.440" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.599" end="00:34:46.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone&#39;s been waiting for you all</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.440" end="00:34:46.159" style="s2">afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.509" end="00:34:53.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.280" end="00:34:53.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you, Mommy and Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.679" end="00:34:57.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We love you, too, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.679" end="00:35:01.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I may have inherited [music] billions,</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.200" end="00:35:01.720" style="s2">but you two are my greatest treasure.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
